#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:82
#: c635fca07d5345dc9396332af8c1ad2d
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:83
#: 0854d3be56cc4c2bb34104b83a241246
msgid "RC input is configured on the R2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:85
#: a90ed3d5017d43958f60a5cc37cf9c02
msgid "FPort requires connection to T2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:87
#: 358d75e7c7c84c5ea7cf7698129f2c6d
msgid "CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:89
#: df10edbc46f04a239de4f17996f1e252
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:91
#: 5a6a793df38548a98a6935ec01b69ccc
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:94
#: f00f13fe374e48289f591de0813adf9b
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:96
#: 6b624cedb71a4d8d87bca43b5c527aaa
msgid "The autopilot  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD support on UART4. Both the internal analog OSD and the DisplayPort OSD can be used simultaneously by setting :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:100
#: ae5e5801227f47b4a3a743f2285a5533
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:101
#: cdbdbd9122174d0db86489eb2d1b80dd
msgid "The BLITZ Wing H743 has 13 PWM outputs. The first 8 outputs support bi-directional DShot and DShot, as well as all PWM types. Outputs 9-10 support DShot, as well as all PWM types and outputs 11-12 only support PWM. Output 13 is pre-configured for serial LED."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:103
#: 5f444db457fb4693980a1774ca522aa8
msgid "The PWM are in in five groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:106
#: da9a7f56d8c240768a3a63e249041cfa
msgid "PWM 1-2 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:107
#: 90e29d86a417444a8bc95a013091f8df
msgid "PWM 3-6 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:108
#: e43bea0177494b50bdb068ec1614b425
msgid "PWM 7-10 in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:109
#: da17da479b78416488179940312a17ba
msgid "PWM 11-12 in group4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:110
#: ba3593dcefd540bcb99190a74bab2486
msgid "PWM 13 in group5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:112
#: 0e7b0e19e29f4c6b95fe840b48ddbcdc
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:117
#: 8c84f5bba19b482fb5797a41633daaeb
msgid "Video Power Control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:119
#: 1a1e216410e742799b57d0ba6d101d51
msgid "The 9V video power can be turned off/on  using GPIO 81 which is already assigned by default to RELAY2.  This relay can be controlled either from the GCS or using a transmitter channel (See :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:122
#: 691fe7db752e4a4bad0d6134b6e45e71
msgid "Camera Switch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:123
#: c4114dc4022745ff839d2b74d133e770
msgid "The camera inputs (Vi1,Vi2) can be switched using GPIO 82 which is already assigned by default to RELAY3.  This relay can be controlled either from the GCS or using a transmitter channel (See :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:126
#: 89b6061903114b648a8123c8c567e01f
msgid "Analog Airspeed Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:128
#: 368673471f5a4a59a623e3f035a077d4
msgid "The analog airspeed pin is \"4\" and is marked \"AIR\" on the board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:131
#: 31856c1e318f4908beddc454c7cc8b10
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:133
#: c9577ef8aae94fabaebc8baa1f52347e
msgid "The board has a built-in voltage sensor and  current sensor. The voltage sensor can handle up to 8S LiPo batteries."
msgstr ""

