#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:159
#: 5c7612825c424a4684371301ddb5cc03
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:161
#: 5fd5312d811c4f14b0fbf0210562eb5e
msgid "Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:165
#: 789f0a117cc947e6a03b8be3f0390467
msgid "Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the \\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr ""
